   513	- Each of these gives `SIG_PACKET`:
   514	  - any other first byte: an OpenPGP-format `0xC2` header, another packet tag, or ASCII armor's `-`;
   515	  - a longer length form than needed.
   516	- This also excludes partial and indeterminate lengths.
   517	
   518	*The packet body (`SIG_FORMAT`).* The body is, in order:
   519	1. version `04`, type `00`, public-key algorithm `13` (19, ECDSA), hash algorithm `08` (SHA-256);
   520	2. `u16` hashed length, then the hashed subpackets;
   521	3. `u16` unhashed length, then the unhashed subpackets;
   522	4. two bytes: the left 16 bits of the digest;
   523	5. MPI r;
   524	6. MPI s.
